tent": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe places, neighborhoods and countries in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Travel and Transportation"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about travel and transportation, you use prepositions. <br/>You can travel <span class = \"strong\">to</span> places and travel <span class = \"strong\">around</span> places .<br/>When you travel <span class = \"strong\">to</span> a place, you go there.<br/>When you travel <span class = \"strong\">around</span> a place, you are there. You explore the place.<br/>When you talk about a city, you can use <span class=\"strong\">there is</span> or <span class=\"strong\">there are</span> to say what is there.<br/><br/>Here are some methods of transportation."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Transportation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"car\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">by a car</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">in a car</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"train\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">by train<br/>on a train<br/>take a train</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">by bus<br/>on a bus<br/>take a bus</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"boat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">by boat<br/>on a boat<br/>on board a boat</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"taxi\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">by taxi<br/>in a taxi</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "They prefer to travel by car."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We can spend the day on board a boat in the harbor."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Let's take a taxi."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Get on the bus!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "square"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an open area in a city with four equal sides"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They sit in the square in the evening and watch people walk by."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear when you talk about cities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stadium"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large structure for sports events"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our team is playing at the stadium this weekend."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sights"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "interesting places to see in a city"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's go to Boston and see the sights!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tourist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person visiting a city or country. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many tourists in the art gallery."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pizzeria"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place that makes pizza"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That pizzeria makes real Italian-style pizza!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spot"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's go to all of the tourist spots in Boston!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "subway"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an underground train"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We can take the subway in Boston next time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le09ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking about a City"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about a city, you can use <span class = \"italic\">There is ... </span> or <span class = \"italic\">There are ... ?</span> to say what is there."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Singular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Plural\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There is lots to see.<br />There is a pizzeria nearby.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There are lots of people around.<br />There are lots of tourists.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "There are a lot of pigeons!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "There is a great pizza place nearby."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a city you want to go to. Plan a trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about how you can get there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about when it's a good time to go."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about what you want to see."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph about the trip. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about transportation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about places to see in a city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about plans for a trip."}]}], "type": "sena"}